///|
/// H.264 CAVLC / dequantisation tables, extracted from FFmpeg 9.0.2
/// `libavcodec/h264_cavlc.c`, `libavcodec/h264data.c` and
/// `libavcodec/mathtables.c`.
///
/// Original FFmpeg code is LGPL-2.1-or-later; this port keeps the same license.
/// The arrays are batch-extracted from the C source (no manual transcription).
/// Ragged C initialisers (`total_zeros_*`, `run_*`) are zero-padded to the
/// declared row width, matching the implicit zero initialisation in C (a
/// length of 0 marks an unused VLC entry). `h264_zigzag_scan` is the standard
/// raster-order zigzag scan from `ff_zigzag_scan`; `h264_chroma_dc_scan` is
/// the 4:2:0 DC scan expanded to block offsets 0/16/32/48.

